  "version": "0.18.0-alpha.1",
  "notes": "> **⚠️ Important notice for users on 0.14.0-alpha.9 – 0.14.0**: these versions have a bug that prevents automatic updates from completing. Please open `https://uniclipboard.app/download` in your browser, download the latest installer, and reinstall manually.\n\n## 0.18.0-alpha.1 - 2026-07-02\n\n### Features\n\n- Show real thumbnails for image items in the Quick Panel, including a thumbnail wall when the image filter is active (#1266)\n- Let the main window close fully while UniClipboard stays available from the tray and reopens normally when needed (#1272)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Opening Settings from the tray now works even after the main window has been closed (#1272)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n> **⚠️ 重要公告（0.14.0-alpha.9 ~ 0.14.0 用户）**：这些版本存在自动更新缺陷，点击安装后无法完成更新。请在浏览器中打开 `https://uniclipboard.app/download`，手动下载最新安装包覆盖安装。\n\n## 0.18.0-alpha.1 - 2026-07-02\n\n### Features\n\n- 快捷面板中的图片项目现在会显示真实缩略图，并在启用图片筛选时显示缩略图墙 (#1266)\n- 关闭主窗口后 UniClipboard 仍会留在托盘中，需要时可正常重新打开窗口 (#1272)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复关闭主窗口后从托盘打开设置可能无法跳转的问题 (#1272)",
